      `the officer exhibits the King's letters patent of summons for a debt which the deceased owed to the King` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the chattels are found upon the lay fief` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the value to be attached` IS A NUMBER
      `the debt owed to the King` IS A NUMBER
      `it is done at the sight of lawful men` IS A BOOLEAN
