    IF officer EQUALS `a sheriff` OR officer EQUALS `a bailiff`
    THEN IF   `the holder of a lay fief of the King has died`
          AND `the officer exhibits the King's letters patent of summons for a debt which the deceased owed to the King`
         THEN IF   `the chattels are found upon the lay fief`
               AND `the value to be attached` AT MOST `the debt owed to the King`
               AND `it is done at the sight of lawful men`
              THEN Entitled
