         ELSE `Not entitled`
    -- NOTHING-kind (word not the condition here: if because "if" conditions the officer's power on a death and letters; the branch is reached by an officer who is not "our sheriff or bailiff", whom the sentence does not name).
    ELSE `Entitlement not covered`

