      `the seller permits postponement` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party Act
DECIDE `ch 28 -- no constable or other bailiff shall take corn or other provisions without immediately tendering money` IS
    IF `ch 28 -- the officer may take corn or other provisions in this way` officer `he tenders money for it immediately` `the seller permits postponement` EQUALS Barred
    THEN PARTY officer
